      "machineHash": "1c349e7c6aa87a473a7dc9829c56189fe9d49bc454f80144e0b91a339a58bccd",
      "machineText": "Os principais recursos da integração do Wails v3 com a bandeja do sistema incluem:",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "Key features of the Wails v3 system tray integration include:",
      "provider": "codex",
